        <mxCell id="t25" value="On pull requests: plan only, posted as a PR comment. Environment-scoped identities and secrets; GitHub environments &amp;lt;env&amp;gt;-plan (no gate) and &amp;lt;env&amp;gt; (reviewers) / ADO environments terraform-&amp;lt;env&amp;gt;." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#605E5C;" vertex="1" parent="b13"><mxGeometry x="20" y="150" width="1050" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
